B.W1=new A.aC("Keen Eye","Keen eyes prevent other Pok\xe9mon from lowering accuracy.")
B.Wx=new A.aC("Leaf Guard","Prevents status conditions in harsh sunlight.")
B.Wk=new A.aC("Levitate","By floating in the air, the Pok\xe9mon receives full immunity to Ground-type moves.")
B.Wj=new A.aC("Lightning Rod","Draws in Electric moves to take no damage and raise Sp. Atk.")
B.W0=new A.aC("Limber","Its limber body protects the Pok\xe9mon from paralysis.")
B.Vz=new A.aC("Liquid Ooze","Oozing liquid damages foes using HP-draining moves instead of healing them.")
B.W2=new A.aC("Magic Guard","The Pok\xe9mon only takes damage from direct attacks, ignoring status, weather, and recoil.")
B.VF=new A.aC("Magnet Pull","Traps opposing Steel-type Pok\xe9mon in battle.")
B.Vc=new A.aC("Marvel Scale","Boosts Defense by 50% if the Pok\xe9mon has a status condition.")
B.WE=new A.aC("Mold Breaker","Moves ignore defensive Abilities on the target (like Levitate or Sturdy).")
